[{"title":"闻世基补漳吏寄赠兼简灵源上人","author":"廖大圭","text":"捧檄天南一笑春，几年身作卧云人。\n相材自古出胥吏，史传后来无逸民。\n清镜多情犹白发，青山有路隔红尘。\n旧游西寺灵源在，为报衰年但隐沦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17085,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"十年","author":"廖大圭","text":"十年不见钟鼓食，今岁仍遭饥馑时。\n只道民间须振贷，谁怜我辈亦疲羸。\n强持一钵向何处，自笑空囊尚有诗。\n早觉无钱助官籴，也应屠贩逐群儿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17086,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"吾郡","author":"廖大圭","text":"吾郡从来称佛国，未闻有此食人风。\n凶年竟遣心术变，末俗何由古昔同。\n市近秖今真有虎，物灵犹自避生虫。\n诸公肉食无充耳，急为饥民散腐红。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17087,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"贼起","author":"廖大圭","text":"贼起南州不出兵，守攻一切付诸僧。\n便将焚诵为无益，争奈战征非所能。\n佛法自兹看扫地，吾徒谁复辨坚冰。\n白头归就儒冠老，饮水茅檐乐曲肱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17088,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀惠廓","author":"廖大圭","text":"闻道崎岖盗贼间，为亲扶侍入深山。\n竹林罢泣时供馔，萱草忘忧不解颜。\n乱世几人能色养，故园何日遂生还。\n我家亦有高堂在，音信寥寥道险艰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17089,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"不得惠舟信","author":"廖大圭","text":"一去梅花岭上村，可堪群盗起如云。\n汝身不识今生死，消息何由远听闻。\n旧隐琴书锁秋色，孤城关柝急斜曛。\n四郊此日方多垒，魂梦相寻路不分。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17090,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送钱介夫如临漳别野","author":"廖大圭","text":"南州鼎沸涕堪流，安得如君海上游。\n果陷孤城谁独免，能寻乐土更无愁。\n秫田酿酒终朝醉，荆木开花一树留。\n亦欲奋飞怜老我，丹霞何处强登楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17091,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"辅上人乱后不来","author":"廖大圭","text":"作客桐花苦岁荒，挽衣不住损离肠。\n能无一壑同薇蕨，秖说故山多稻粱。\n回首想应豺断道，寄书未有雁成行。\n时危老我空相忆，况是孤城闭夕阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17092,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用韵题松云八景图 其一","author":"廖大圭","text":"一到城西甘露寺，只今山色似当时。\n清谈客去云长在，乞食僧还鹤正羸。\n松柏青青犹古意，茅茨历历有新诗。\n曾知此地多风月，寄语烦嚣世上儿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17093,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用韵题松云八景图 其二 淮桥上归别许生","author":"廖大圭","text":"高树新凉雨意，断桥落日水声。\n中有幽人独立，白云一片犹横。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17094,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用韵题松云八景图 其三","author":"廖大圭","text":"晚色诗情澹澹，秋阴客影冥冥。\n回头试问淮水，何时重到南亭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17095,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用韵题松云八景图 其四 无题","author":"廖大圭","text":"树影半窗明月，虫声一夜清秋。\n我意浩然千古，人间总是閒愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17096,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用韵题松云八景图 其五 必上人所居竹","author":"廖大圭","text":"白日炎氛远，清阴敷广庭。\n岁寒抱高节，霜雪独青青。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17097,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用韵题松云八景图 其六 桐下井","author":"廖大圭","text":"晓风吹银床，萧萧古桐树。\n时有新汲人，瓶携落花去。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17098,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用韵题松云八景图 其七 龟峰绝顶","author":"廖大圭","text":"危石青入云，上有千岁木。\n我来卧其间，天风响岩谷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17099,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用韵题松云八景图 其八 石上","author":"廖大圭","text":"久坐大石上，青天行白云。\n野意道不得，幽鸟隔林闻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17100,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"淩霞观旧迹","author":"廖大圭","text":"石壁立万丈，仙人青云端。\n不见来笙鹤，落日天风寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17101,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"行松林中雨欲至","author":"廖大圭","text":"石磴下欲尽，松林新径开。\n黑云何处雨，时过帽山来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17102,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雨少止下山","author":"廖大圭","text":"苦爱山色好，独乘清兴来。\n归时却惆怅，石径有莓苔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17103,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雨归","author":"廖大圭","text":"不向青山宿，青山笑杀人。\n黄昏独归去，衣上雨痕新。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17104,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"归至中野","author":"廖大圭","text":"雨色澹微阳，归情已当急。\n空野夕凉多，共对青山立。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17105,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山雨","author":"廖大圭","text":"山雨夜鸣屋，凉秋风满林。\n一贫才到骨，万事已无心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17106,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"亦有","author":"廖大圭","text":"亦有往还者，自懒与相期。\n独坐柴门里，青山无去时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17107,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"见月","author":"廖大圭","text":"天地几昏晓，浮生半是眠。\n寄声世上客，明月为谁圆。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17108,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"闻蛩","author":"廖大圭","text":"蛩鸣东壁东，蛩鸣西壁西。\n老我中间坐，远近一闻齐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17109,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"迟明","author":"廖大圭","text":"山晓欲无色，鸡寒犹有声。\n客中魂梦少，风雨隔林生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17110,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渔父","author":"廖大圭","text":"大儿船头新得鱼，小儿船头炊彫胡。\n老翁一笑江潮落，西村有酒满瓶沽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17111,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜起","author":"廖大圭","text":"野人独卧山中屋，夜半雨声清梦熟。\n起来竹下一开门，秋入千峰月如玉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17112,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"顾氏亭菊","author":"廖大圭","text":"顾家亭馆四时佳，薄暮来过到月斜。\n徙倚不知秋色冷，赤阑干外有黄花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17113,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"德林","author":"廖大圭","text":"我是道林君德林，休论异趣不同心。\n三株树下扶疏月，几日来听子夜琴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17114,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵詹生腊雨不出 其一","author":"廖大圭","text":"憧憧入市蹋泥行，独有高人息外营。\n隐几读书心似水，空斋不断雨来声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17115,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵詹生腊雨不出 其二","author":"廖大圭","text":"愁生怀抱苦无端，岁晏囊空阻一欢。\n欲折梅花当分岁，黄昏飞雪满城寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17116,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"呼同游","author":"廖大圭","text":"春山雨后碧如苔，为问閒人几个来。\n不去题诗岩下石，涧花红白为谁开。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17117,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题龙引子朝天画","author":"廖大圭","text":"渊龙飞出雾如山，龙子相随闯九关。\n遥想云霄新得路，雨声一夜到人间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17118,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书雪夜访戴图","author":"廖大圭","text":"万古神交共此心，当时何事下山阴。\n遥遥一棹言相访，安道门前雪正深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17119,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山谷草圣","author":"廖大圭","text":"涪翁醉墨动惊蛇，流落人间几岁华。\n长恐六丁起雷电，为龙飞去玉皇家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17120,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赤壁画","author":"廖大圭","text":"寒山影落大江流，赤壁应难似旧游。\n风月当年收拾尽，黄州副使一扁舟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17121,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和用平怀南上人三绝句 其一","author":"廖大圭","text":"寒窗贝叶共平生，听尽灯前片雨声。\n今日悲凉只孤坐，残编上见蠹鱼行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17122,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和用平怀南上人三绝句 其二","author":"廖大圭","text":"人间友道冷于秋，伐木无声万古愁。\n头白东峰一遗老，独寻宿草吊荒丘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17123,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和用平怀南上人三绝句 其三","author":"廖大圭","text":"寒云长闭旧林庐，魂魄归来日已疏。\n欲见怀人更无路，空山秋色对禽鱼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17124,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"看山","author":"廖大圭","text":"青山远近画图间，落日秋风得意看。\n紫翠重重归鸟尽，四窗不掩石楼寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17125,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"卖书赆友 其一","author":"廖大圭","text":"故人欲行万里外，自言囊橐尚空虚。\n我贫无物堪为赆，卖却平生一束书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17126,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"卖书赆友 其二","author":"廖大圭","text":"通财我亦闻诸古，空有平生气义高。\n深愧穷途负朋友，极怜富室积金刀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17127,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长门怨","author":"廖大圭","text":"娥眉无绿镜生寒，忍见铜铺月又圆。\n一片君王心似昨，曾将金屋贮婵娟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17128,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"瑶台曲","author":"廖大圭","text":"冠佩朝天逐伴归，玉箫声里露沾衣。\n曲终十二楼头月，万里青云一鹤飞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17129,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"诘鬻香者","author":"廖大圭","text":"户外声声卖紫檀，贫家谁办买香钱。\n如何不向朱门唤，沉水烟中人醉眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17130,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"郑老人","author":"廖大圭","text":"白头含笑倒长瓢，话到前朝感慨饶。\n无复吐茵当日梦，海云楼上对春潮。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17131,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"闻莺","author":"廖大圭","text":"竹边睍睆梦魂惊，啼破春风似有情。\n花榭柳台听得惯，金衣好去九重城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17132,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"出山自笑","author":"廖大圭","text":"都将声利付时人，野鹤孤云物外身。\n底事半生双白足，今朝蹋破一红尘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17133,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"苦旱","author":"廖大圭","text":"春秧黄槁百泉枯，龙骨声中泣老夫。\n不恨长饥委沟壑，长官秋至索王租。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17134,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"王季鸿相邀不去寄谢","author":"廖大圭","text":"闭门藏拙久云林，俎豆诸贤愧此心。\n珍重形骸外相见，春风尘壁下桐琴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17135,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀复初翁 其一","author":"廖大圭","text":"玉立清标不受尘，闭门寒趣自生春。\n东山兴尽归来后，一树梅花对病身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17136,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀复初翁 其二","author":"廖大圭","text":"世涂差狭道难行，独负文章一代名。\n旧日著书无恙不，人间千载子云生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17137,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀复初翁 其三","author":"廖大圭","text":"铁石平生一寸心，如何西望亦沾襟。\n丛林元气关公等，不说钟期莫铸金。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17138,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"石笋溪堂","author":"廖大圭","text":"白沙青树带人家，门外溪声一派斜。\n欲买扁舟同野老，月明吹笛入蘋花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17139,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"卧疾怀金粟山人","author":"廖大圭","text":"身不能飞秖自愁，闭门卧病尽高秋。\n无因去作山人客，长啸清风十二楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17140,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"示同袍 其一","author":"廖大圭","text":"天南为客度黄花，一笑归来共岁华。\n老我不知身是病，自吹松火熟杯茶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17141,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"示同袍 其二","author":"廖大圭","text":"试论心事一开颜，万事如今只等閒。\n病起朝朝相唤去，海城西北尽青山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17142,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"病起简所知 其一","author":"廖大圭","text":"清白堂前客似云，新诗唫罢倒芳尊。\n不知尚记龙钟不，病起云深独掩门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17143,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"病起简所知 其二","author":"廖大圭","text":"长恐心期愧古人，半生曾未拜车尘。\n独怜身世枯蓬草，零落秋风不见春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17144,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"池上","author":"廖大圭","text":"绿净涵空护碧苔，方方一镜向人开。\n晚凉独立心如洗，风破浮萍片月来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17145,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"感蠹书鱼","author":"廖大圭","text":"临窗清晓独长吁，在眼陈编有蠹鱼。\n身世区区文字底，当时鲁叟亦捐书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17146,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"闻杜宇","author":"廖大圭","text":"情知望帝是前生，春尽江南忆锦城。\n到处青山山有树，如何偏起故乡情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17147,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜宿李氏馆","author":"廖大圭","text":"坐我高斋笑语新，此时归思浩然生。\n不因乘兴一来往，争识孤云物外情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17148,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"有怀","author":"廖大圭","text":"落日孤城想故人，三千客路浙江濆。\n恨身不解相随得，目送长风北去云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17149,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其一 晦忠堂","author":"廖大圭","text":"新堂犹揭旧堂名，坐记当年一怆情。\n万里虎头身许国，归来烟雨课春耕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17150,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其二 菱风桂露之乡","author":"廖大圭","text":"菱叶风来水气浮，桂花露湿月明秋。\n此时身在银河上，不蹑仙槎驾玉虬。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17151,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其三 一川平野","author":"廖大圭","text":"雨过群山扫绿埃，无穷野色望中开。\n渔樵往往斜阳外，只隔前川唤不来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17152,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其四 水木清华","author":"廖大圭","text":"春流绕屋似江湖，绿树当门作画图。\n白日风波浑不见，一双鸥鸟起投壶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17153,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其五 燕寝凝香","author":"廖大圭","text":"眼冷樽前舞袖红，日长高枕自清风。\n功名扰扰平生梦，分付黄云一穟中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17154,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其六 池塘春草","author":"廖大圭","text":"二仪清气几曾衰，前辈风流可得追。\n康乐后身孙处士，一池春草梦回时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17155,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其七 草堂","author":"廖大圭","text":"杜老高风六百年，茅茨那得尚依然。\n侧身西望人多少，万里桥头不尽天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17156,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其八 处士桥","author":"廖大圭","text":"无意趋时爱泬寥，一溪流水断尘嚣。\n幽人石上看云坐，车马来时莫过桥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17157,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其九 山阴溪曲","author":"廖大圭","text":"清溪流绕碧㠝岏，便作山阴一样看。\n今日戴公何处在，满船风雪不知寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17158,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其十 总相宜船","author":"廖大圭","text":"彩鹢不飞连碧波，此中公子醉眠多。\n傍人刚道相宜好，梦入西湖闻棹歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17159,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其十一 翠香馆","author":"廖大圭","text":"万瓮吹香客到稀，青帘故故舞斜晖。\n主人家有如渑酒，不脱鹴裘得醉归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17160,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南墅十二诗 其十二 啸云台","author":"廖大圭","text":"高台直上接青云，一啸晴空十里闻。\n天上神仙平地有，群儿何事醉尘氛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17161,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晨兴涉园","author":"廖大圭","text":"绕畦青青蔬叶凉，渠水新添一尺强。\n倚杖方知山雨过，夜来底事梦魂长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17162,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]